{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "description": "Equal-area hexagonal aggregation of the TSX 2025 reptiles/amphibians monitoring-region centroids. Each species (TaxonID) is counted once per hexagon and group; time-series row counts are not population sizes. Hexagon geometry is generated from an Australian Albers (EPSG:3577) regular grid with 150 km centre-to-vertex radius. Hexagons are not clipped to coastlines and may span state borders.",
